    "detailed_description": "<strong>Vagrant Knight is a top-down challenging action roguelike </strong> <br>with hack-n-slash combat mechanics paired with spell casting.<br>Clear each room of never-ending horde of monsters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301690/extras/90c4edc65602ba13dfe20455f51e3a7a.poster.avif?t=1685708985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301690/extras/90c4edc65602ba13dfe20455f51e3a7a.webm?t=1685708985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301690/extras/90c4edc65602ba13dfe20455f51e3a7a.mp4?t=1685708985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At end of each level, <br><strong>upgrade your character melee attack  or equip yourself with new spell</strong>.<br>Discover how each combination of these melee weapon enchantment<br>and spell slinging take out incoming enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301690/extras/c33f878dc291576eeff3ee44501a67ca.poster.avif?t=1685708985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301690/extras/c33f878dc291576eeff3ee44501a67ca.webm?t=1685708985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301690/extras/c33f878dc291576eeff3ee44501a67ca.mp4?t=1685708985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose from 32 unique spells to cast onto enemies.<br></li><li>Enhance your melee attacks with any of 22 special attacks.<br></li><li>Boost your stats with 18 unique traits.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.st